@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+---
+'@radix-ui/react-slot': patch
+---
+
+Fixed "Maximum update depth exceeded" in React 19: `Slot` now composes the forwarded and child refs with the memoized `useComposedRefs` instead of creating a new `composeRefs` callback on every render. A new callback ref identity per render made React 19 detach and re-invoke the ref on every commit, which loops forever when the ref updates state (e.g. `useSize`, or editors such as Slate/Plate).
